ERROR:  row-level AFTER triggers on columnar tables are not supported
HINT:  Use a BEFORE ROW or a statement-level trigger, or keep the table in row storage.
CONTEXT:  PL/pgSQL function columnar_check_ddl() line 55 at RAISE
